00:46:04.660 --> 00:46:05.300
L'automatisation

00:46:05.300 --> 00:46:06.140
dans Defender XDR

00:46:06.140 --> 00:46:07.440
Defender agit déjà

00:46:07.440 --> 00:46:08.020
