00:48:14.740 --> 00:48:15.400
Les groupes d'appareils

00:48:15.400 --> 00:48:15.980
les plus récents

00:48:15.980 --> 00:48:16.520
ou incertains

00:48:16.520 --> 00:48:16.940
restent au niveau

00:48:16.940 --> 00:48:17.400
le plus bas

00:48:17.400 --> 00:48:18.400
