00:48:42.320 --> 00:48:43.000
de corriger le signal

00:48:43.000 --> 00:48:43.540
avant de lui donner

00:48:43.540 --> 00:48:44.240
plus de pouvoir.

00:48:45.060 --> 00:48:45.900
La précision passe avant,

00:48:46.140 --> 00:48:46.620
l'étendue suit

00:48:46.620 --> 00:48:47.880
